1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 10]

34
00:02:20,540 --> 00:02:21,500
They've been fighting forever.

35
00:02:21,940 --> 00:02:22,710
Why isn't it over yet?

36
00:02:23,770 --> 00:02:24,680
What's the rush?

37
00:02:25,490 --> 00:02:26,920
The top candidate two years ago

38
00:02:26,930 --> 00:02:27,960
fought one opponent after another

39
00:02:28,310 --> 00:02:29,710
for two days and two nights.

40
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:31,360
Two days and two nights?

41
00:02:34,070 --> 00:02:35,360
Fengyi Guards on missions

42
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:37,400
often stay undercover for days.

43
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:38,970
Mosquito and insect bites.

44
00:02:39,150 --> 00:02:39,960
Attacks by wild beasts.

45
00:02:40,410 --> 00:02:41,490
If you can't even last a day,

46
00:02:41,980 --> 00:02:43,010
how can you be a Fengyi Guard?

47
00:02:46,380 --> 00:02:47,520
The combat trial is over.

48
00:02:47,750 --> 00:02:48,850
The strategy trial is tomorrow.

49
00:02:49,620 --> 00:02:53,020
[Fengyi Guard Selection Strategy Trial]

50
00:02:53,980 --> 00:02:55,500
[Entrance]

51
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:56,360
[Xu Shao]

52
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,000
Shao.

53
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:58,870
Mother

54
00:02:58,870 --> 00:03:00,080
is waiting for you at home.

55
00:03:00,630 --> 00:03:02,360
She's cried her eyes out.

56
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:06,630
Shao?

57
00:03:19,880 --> 00:03:21,150
The strategy trial begins.

58
00:03:26,710 --> 00:03:29,750
Her build does look a little like hers.

59
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:32,230
But her hands are fair and delicate.

60
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,470
Not those of a martial artist.

61
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:34,930
She vanished for months.

62
00:03:35,610 --> 00:03:37,150
How could a frail girl

63
00:03:37,550 --> 00:03:40,310
become a Fengyi Guard candidate?

64
00:03:41,690 --> 00:03:43,030
You have one incense stick's time.

65
00:03:43,570 --> 00:03:46,190
Anyone who fails to finish in time
is eliminated.

66
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:48,530
You may obstruct each other,

67
00:03:48,730 --> 00:03:51,680
but hidden weapons mean failure.

68
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:53,000
Ready.

69
00:03:55,030 --> 00:03:55,840
Begin.

70
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,310
Out of my way. Move.

71
00:04:27,950 --> 00:04:28,800
Your Highness.

72
00:04:29,460 --> 00:04:31,500
This trial may take some time.

73
00:04:31,510 --> 00:04:33,000
Perhaps you should return
to the Eastern Palace and rest.

74
00:04:36,070 --> 00:04:36,600
You may go.

75
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,630
Thinking on it now,

76
00:04:42,630 --> 00:04:44,120
I underestimated her.

77
00:04:44,830 --> 00:04:46,160
When she was twelve,

78
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:48,120
she once put on quite an act.

79
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:51,810
[Outside the Exam Grounds]
She tricked our parents to look for her.

80
00:04:51,810 --> 00:04:54,390
Meanwhile, she dressed as a maid

81
00:04:54,610 --> 00:04:56,640
and slipped into the crowd to sneak out.

82
00:04:57,430 --> 00:04:59,630
She almost made it.

83
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:01,340
The younger Lady is very clever.

84
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:04,070
The younger Lady is cunning.

85
00:05:05,070 --> 00:05:06,230
Clever

86
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,480
or cunning,

87
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:09,390
she spent eighteen years

88
00:05:09,390 --> 00:05:10,950
as a pampered young lady.

89
00:05:11,310 --> 00:05:12,720
But now I think of it,

90
00:05:13,610 --> 00:05:15,920
she was but a caged bird.

91
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:18,310
You're right, my lady.

92
00:05:18,650 --> 00:05:19,880
Time is half up.

93
00:05:19,890 --> 00:05:20,880
Why hasn't anyone come out?

94
00:05:21,330 --> 00:05:22,390
If Madam Xu cannot get out,

95
00:05:22,900 --> 00:05:24,120
shall we plead with Lord Pei?

96
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:25,000
Lord Pei said

97
00:05:25,550 --> 00:05:26,450
if she passes, she stays.

98
00:05:26,940 --> 00:05:27,760
If she fails,

99
00:05:28,180 --> 00:05:29,160
she has to leave.

100
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:30,800
When did he say that?

101
00:05:31,180 --> 00:05:31,800
I didn't hear it.

102
00:05:32,070 --> 00:05:32,510
Doesn't count.

103
00:05:32,950 --> 00:05:33,520
What?

104
00:05:33,750 --> 00:05:34,870
You're Chief Commander now?

105
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:36,480
Soon.

106
00:05:41,010 --> 00:05:43,170
Whether she's Yun Shao or not,

107
00:05:44,510 --> 00:05:48,010
she won't make it out of this maze.

108
00:06:05,490 --> 00:06:06,100
It's her.

109
00:06:10,100 --> 00:06:10,590
After her.

110
00:06:17,570 --> 00:06:18,230
Where can you run now?

111
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:26,830
Lord Pei.

112
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:30,480
Why can't we see anyone?

113
00:06:30,810 --> 00:06:31,340
Where are they?

114
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,600
Time isn't up yet.

115
00:06:53,820 --> 00:06:54,700
[Xu Shao]

116
00:06:54,870 --> 00:06:55,680
First place.

117
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:05,630
And this is...

118
00:07:06,310 --> 00:07:07,120
Guard Xu.

119
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:08,160
Reward her.

120
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:10,140
[Xu Shao]

121
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:14,190
I hollowed out the beads

122
00:07:14,190 --> 00:07:16,430
and filled them
with disorienting spices.

123
00:07:16,820 --> 00:07:18,860
It contains patchouli,

124
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:21,160
which enhances the drug's effect.

125
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:23,000
It made it easy to knock them all out.

126
00:07:23,430 --> 00:07:25,680
How did you know
this year's trial would be a maze?

127
00:07:27,510 --> 00:07:28,630
Did Lord Pei secretly tell you?

128
00:07:29,310 --> 00:07:30,800
He'd never do that.

129
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:31,550
Exactly.

130
00:07:31,900 --> 00:07:33,000
You might as well suspect

131
00:07:33,010 --> 00:07:34,270
I told Guard Xu.

132
00:07:35,730 --> 00:07:37,190
I studied records of past exams.

133
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,600
They're all pretty similar,

134
00:07:39,100 --> 00:07:41,420
usually about escaping from danger.

135
00:07:42,110 --> 00:07:42,920
So you see,

136
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:45,790
he may look cold and heartless,

137
00:07:46,070 --> 00:07:47,860
but he cares for the Fengyi Guard.

138
00:07:48,750 --> 00:07:49,960
Take Chang'an's wooden kite,

139
00:07:50,310 --> 00:07:52,190
and Lu's Water Escape Technique.

140
00:07:52,190 --> 00:07:53,390
They serve a similar purpose.

141
00:07:54,830 --> 00:07:56,000
As for mine,

142
00:07:56,390 --> 00:07:59,870
I'll call it
the Incense Escape Technique.

143
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,630
Impressive.

144
00:08:03,070 --> 00:08:04,040
At ease.

145
00:08:06,510 --> 00:08:09,040
I admire your technique, Guard Xu.

146
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:11,430
I'm holding a banquet
the day after tomorrow.

147
00:08:11,430 --> 00:08:13,120
Guard Xu, come with Pei Zhao.

148
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:14,600
Yes, Your Highness.

149
00:08:17,190 --> 00:08:19,720
Don't you like what I gave you?

150
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:20,510
Why aren't you wearing it?

151
00:08:21,190 --> 00:08:22,190
I wouldn't neglect

152
00:08:22,190 --> 00:08:23,000
a gift from Your Highness.

153
00:08:23,630 --> 00:08:25,070
But I just finished the selection

154
00:08:25,070 --> 00:08:26,000
and I'm covered in dust.

155
00:08:26,990 --> 00:08:28,510
I was afraid I'd stain your gift.

156
00:08:29,190 --> 00:08:29,830
Doesn't matter.

157
00:08:30,070 --> 00:08:31,720
Wear it to the Eastern Palace.

158
00:08:31,950 --> 00:08:32,750
Yes, Your Highness.

159
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,000
- Not her.
- Go.

160
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,820
So they were behind it.

161
00:08:49,570 --> 00:08:50,930
Good thing I was prepared.

162
00:08:53,550 --> 00:08:56,200
I really became a Fengyi Guard.

163
00:09:08,030 --> 00:09:09,200
You're the first female Fengyi Guard.

164
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:09,790
Sir.

165
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:13,320
You got lucky this time
with your little trick.

166
00:09:13,470 --> 00:09:14,120
But remember,

167
00:09:14,420 --> 00:09:16,810
every mission is life or death.

168
00:09:17,550 --> 00:09:19,480
You can still walk away.

169
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:20,610
My mind is made up.

170
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:21,780
I do not fear death.

171
00:09:22,510 --> 00:09:23,010
Good.

172
00:09:24,420 --> 00:09:25,790
What did the Crown Prince give you?

173
00:09:26,150 --> 00:09:26,810
I haven't looked.

174
00:09:28,580 --> 00:09:30,250
Sir, you open it.

175
00:09:31,590 --> 00:09:32,840
It was given to you.

176
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:33,870
Open it yourself.

177
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:35,400
I'm a Fengyi Guard now.

178
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:37,000
Everything I have belongs to you.

179
00:09:37,150 --> 00:09:38,000
Even my life.

180
00:09:38,610 --> 00:09:39,720
Nonsense.

181
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:40,960
What would I do with your life?

182
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:41,910
Feed it to the pigeons?

183
00:09:47,670 --> 00:09:48,840
A Fangfei bracelet?

184
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:52,360
These beads are quite fine.

185
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:57,550
You like it?

186
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:58,880
It's all right.

187
00:09:59,630 --> 00:10:00,840
Why aren't you wearing it?

188
00:10:01,870 --> 00:10:02,870
I'm a Fengyi Guard.

189
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:06,270
I don't wear flashy things like that.

190
00:10:06,900 --> 00:10:07,500
Good.

191
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:09,080
At least you know your place.

192
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:11,150
But,

193
00:10:13,090 --> 00:10:14,480
if you really like it,

194
00:10:14,930 --> 00:10:17,240
the Fengyi Bureau can get you one.

195
00:10:17,870 --> 00:10:18,670
All right.

196
00:10:20,670 --> 00:10:21,120
Here.

197
00:10:21,210 --> 00:10:21,960
This is for you.

198
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,360
It's so golden.

199
00:10:26,950 --> 00:10:27,390
Sir.

200
00:10:27,970 --> 00:10:28,870
Does it look

201
00:10:29,050 --> 00:10:30,420
like a little lantern?

202
00:10:31,630 --> 00:10:32,270
You don't like it?

203
00:10:32,940 --> 00:10:33,490
Then throw it away.

204
00:10:34,750 --> 00:10:35,760
You gave it to me,

205
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:36,960
so it's mine now.

206
00:10:38,680 --> 00:10:39,200
Sir.

207
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:43,480
Lu is back.

208
00:10:47,500 --> 00:10:48,870
By the time I got there,

209
00:10:48,870 --> 00:10:49,690
the Gu master was already dead.

210
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:53,160
His wife's eyes had been gouged out,

211
00:10:53,590 --> 00:10:54,500
her tongue cut out,

212
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:57,000
and the tendons
in her hands and feet severed.

213
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:58,780
Also,

214
00:11:00,510 --> 00:11:02,120
the secret Gu techniques were stolen.

215
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:03,510
So,

216
00:11:03,980 --> 00:11:05,200
the only one who can remove the Gu

217
00:11:05,670 --> 00:11:06,970
is the one who implanted it.

218
00:11:07,910 --> 00:11:08,410
Yes.

219
00:11:09,210 --> 00:11:09,720
Right.

220
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:11,970
I found this.

221
00:11:13,270 --> 00:11:14,570
The Gu master's wife must've

222
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:16,030
risked her life to hide it.

223
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:18,330
That person left it behind.

224
00:11:18,910 --> 00:11:19,720
This fish...

225
00:11:20,930 --> 00:11:22,460
He had a dead fish.

226
00:11:22,460 --> 00:11:23,300
A dead fish?

227
00:11:23,920 --> 00:11:25,630
They saw it before.

228
00:11:25,990 --> 00:11:26,750
Could the assassin

229
00:11:26,950 --> 00:11:28,670
and the person who implanted the Gu
be working together?

230
00:11:28,950 --> 00:11:31,270
Offer a reward. Find the fish's owner.

231
00:11:32,490 --> 00:11:34,000
Until we find the owner,

232
00:11:34,550 --> 00:11:36,080
Madam Xu, please take care.

233
00:11:36,550 --> 00:11:38,870
My lord's safety rests with you.

234
00:11:39,340 --> 00:11:41,860
[Fengyi Bureau]

235
00:11:46,030 --> 00:11:46,840
Master.

236
00:11:47,670 --> 00:11:49,910
Who is that female guard?

237
00:11:50,550 --> 00:11:51,440
Well...

238
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:53,270
I do not know.

239
00:11:55,670 --> 00:11:56,230
You do not know?

240
00:11:56,550 --> 00:11:58,720
I will look into it at once.

241
00:11:58,840 --> 00:11:59,410
Good.

242
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:08,720
Fail, and you drink it.

243
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:14,150
I will give my all.

244
00:12:14,670 --> 00:12:15,870
Even unto death.

245
00:12:20,910 --> 00:12:21,930
What I saw

246
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:23,720
was exactly that.

247
00:12:24,170 --> 00:12:27,510
The Crown Prince seems very fond
of that female guard.

248
00:12:28,030 --> 00:12:30,240
He gave her incense beads himself.

249
00:12:30,850 --> 00:12:33,600
They bear the Eastern Palace mark.

250
00:12:33,770 --> 00:12:37,320
He means to take her under him.

251
00:12:38,150 --> 00:12:39,270
What have you found?

252
00:12:41,400 --> 00:12:43,510
Similar, yet not quite.

253
00:12:44,190 --> 00:12:45,800
My sister likes incense too,

254
00:12:46,340 --> 00:12:48,690
but she only ever made sachets.

255
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:51,740
Even sitting long would leave her tired

256
00:12:51,750 --> 00:12:52,790
and breathless.

257
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:54,820
But that female guard

258
00:12:55,700 --> 00:12:57,900
knocked out every other candidate

259
00:12:57,900 --> 00:12:59,000
and took first place.

260
00:13:00,070 --> 00:13:02,700
My sister could never do that.

261
00:13:03,400 --> 00:13:04,640
Whether she is or not,

262
00:13:05,260 --> 00:13:07,320
if the Crown Prince wins her over,

263
00:13:07,330 --> 00:13:08,750
and puts her to use,

264
00:13:08,750 --> 00:13:09,930
that can only be good.

265
00:13:10,890 --> 00:13:14,870
At the banquet, the Crown Prince

266
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:15,910
will ask Pei Zhao for that guard.

267
00:13:16,790 --> 00:13:18,150
The sooner, the better.

268
00:13:18,150 --> 00:13:20,750
Then she won't hover around Pei Zhao

269
00:13:21,040 --> 00:13:22,240
and get on my nerves.

270
00:13:22,930 --> 00:13:24,440
My lady, be patient.

271
00:13:24,790 --> 00:13:26,440
From what Noble Consort implied,

272
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:30,390
your marriage to Pei Zhao is near.

273
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:31,720
Really?

274
00:13:43,790 --> 00:13:46,860
Your Highness, Lord Pei
accepted the imperial decree.

275
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,390
You may go.

276
00:13:49,390 --> 00:13:49,990
Yes, Your Highness.

277
00:13:51,710 --> 00:13:53,080
You foresaw everything, Your Highness.

278
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:57,150
When he was fourteen,

279
00:13:57,340 --> 00:13:59,630
His Majesty appointed him
Chief Commander.

280
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:02,360
He listens to no one else.

281
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:06,910
But he is absolutely loyal
to His Majesty.

282
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:10,200
Whatever His Majesty commands,

283
00:14:11,630 --> 00:14:12,440
he will carry it out.

284
00:14:18,250 --> 00:14:20,150
They seek blood from pure-yin girls.

285
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:22,030
Unless we destroy them,

286
00:14:22,030 --> 00:14:23,440
they will keep taking victims.

287
00:14:23,680 --> 00:14:24,720
We can't let that happen.

288
00:14:25,020 --> 00:14:26,200
We have to catch them soon.

289
00:14:26,940 --> 00:14:28,480
But our only clue right now

290
00:14:28,690 --> 00:14:29,630
is this silver fish.

291
00:14:30,690 --> 00:14:32,200
I posted a rich reward in Ghost Market.

292
00:14:32,440 --> 00:14:33,630
Someone recognized this silver fish.

293
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:35,960
It's the symbol
of a group called Mingyu.

294
00:14:36,520 --> 00:14:37,150
- Sir.
- Sir.

295
00:14:39,630 --> 00:14:40,910
They've always operated in Mingcheng.

296
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:42,790
They're extremely ruthless.

297
00:14:43,160 --> 00:14:44,510
They disappeared nearly ten years ago.

298
00:14:44,980 --> 00:14:46,720
Recently, they have resurfaced.

299
00:14:49,020 --> 00:14:50,300
[Imperial Edict]

300
00:14:50,390 --> 00:14:51,400
My lord has been rewarded again.

301
00:14:51,400 --> 00:14:52,230
What treasure is it?

302
00:14:52,450 --> 00:14:52,880
Quiet.

303
00:14:54,130 --> 00:14:55,240
If we want to catch Mingyu,

304
00:14:56,020 --> 00:14:57,080
we need irresistible bait.

305
00:14:57,730 --> 00:14:58,480
What kind of bait?

306
00:15:00,180 --> 00:15:01,910
They want pure-yin blood.

307
00:15:02,740 --> 00:15:04,270
Someone with pure-yin blood

308
00:15:07,280 --> 00:15:08,150
is the perfect bait.

309
00:15:09,250 --> 00:15:09,620
Sir.

310
00:15:10,030 --> 00:15:11,200
Gifts from the Noble Consort.

311
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:16,270
Congratulations, Lord Pei.

312
00:15:16,270 --> 00:15:18,440
These are gifts from Her Highness.

313
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:19,840
She also said

314
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:21,200
that since you have no parents,

315
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,920
she is willing to be your family

316
00:15:22,930 --> 00:15:24,440
and arrange your marriage.

317
00:15:24,620 --> 00:15:26,800
She'll handle
all the wedding preparations.

318
00:15:26,800 --> 00:15:27,790
My lord is to wed?

319
00:15:28,270 --> 00:15:28,960
To whom?

320
00:15:29,340 --> 00:15:30,960
Lady Yun, of course.

321
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:35,410
Lord Pei, I'll take my leave.

322
00:15:47,790 --> 00:15:48,270
Sir.

323
00:15:48,950 --> 00:15:49,750
We've found Mingyu.

324
00:15:50,450 --> 00:15:53,630
Every girl they take has pure-yin blood.

325
00:15:53,890 --> 00:15:54,960
To uncover the truth,

326
00:15:55,140 --> 00:15:56,830
we must find their leader.

327
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:57,790
Move out.

328
00:16:02,700 --> 00:16:05,020
[Mingcheng]

329
00:16:14,870 --> 00:16:15,750
Madam Xu,

330
00:16:15,980 --> 00:16:16,760
what's wrong?

331
00:16:18,740 --> 00:16:19,510
Have some fruit.

332
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:21,200
Sir.

333
00:16:21,970 --> 00:16:23,670
Why not use another woman as bait?

334
00:16:24,440 --> 00:16:26,670
If Madam Xu gets hurt,

335
00:16:27,120 --> 00:16:28,000
you'll be in danger.

336
00:16:28,870 --> 00:16:30,320
To draw their attention,

337
00:16:30,550 --> 00:16:31,870
they need to see

338
00:16:31,870 --> 00:16:32,960
real pure-yin blood.

339
00:16:33,780 --> 00:16:35,960
But what if something happens?

340
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:38,400
Then watch her closely.

341
00:16:38,420 --> 00:16:39,330
Don't let anything happen to her.

342
00:16:43,670 --> 00:16:44,960
He had no choice.

343
00:16:46,030 --> 00:16:47,150
His Majesty granted the match.

344
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:49,270
I know

345
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:50,670
you have feelings for...

346
00:16:52,670 --> 00:16:53,720
It is no great matter.

347
00:16:54,390 --> 00:16:55,980
Once you earn merit on this mission,

348
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:58,840
you can ask His Majesty to end it.

349
00:16:59,910 --> 00:17:02,080
It has nothing to do with me.

350
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:04,750
Really?

351
00:17:07,440 --> 00:17:08,240
Then have some fruit.

352
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:10,520
Fine.

353
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:14,120
Sir.

354
00:17:15,650 --> 00:17:17,400
Look, he is feeding her fruit now.

355
00:17:17,860 --> 00:17:19,270
Why must it be Ji Chang'an

356
00:17:19,270 --> 00:17:20,200
posing as her husband?

357
00:17:21,090 --> 00:17:22,590
Ji Chang'an is careless by nature.

358
00:17:22,690 --> 00:17:23,720
He is hardly meticulous.

359
00:17:23,930 --> 00:17:25,000
Bring Ji Chang'an back.

360
00:17:26,070 --> 00:17:27,240
Because he is the best fit.

361
00:17:28,350 --> 00:17:30,640
What, you think they suit best?

362
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:33,000
Chang'an is young.

363
00:17:33,270 --> 00:17:35,240
He's like newlywed.

364
00:17:35,980 --> 00:17:37,480
If it were Ruoming and me,

365
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:38,510
we'd give ourselves away.

366
00:17:39,070 --> 00:17:39,720
Just making excuses.

367
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:41,200
Bring Ji Chang'an back.

368
00:17:41,620 --> 00:17:44,270
But when we chose him,

369
00:17:44,270 --> 00:17:45,920
you agreed too.

370
00:17:47,740 --> 00:17:48,740
[Xu Shao]

371
00:17:59,670 --> 00:18:02,480
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

372
00:18:04,100 --> 00:18:07,290
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

373
00:18:08,610 --> 00:18:10,350
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

374
00:18:10,850 --> 00:18:15,290
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

375
00:18:17,450 --> 00:18:20,120
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

376
00:18:21,340 --> 00:18:26,350
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

377
00:18:26,670 --> 00:18:34,700
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

378
00:18:34,970 --> 00:18:43,590
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

379
00:18:43,590 --> 00:18:52,260
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

380
00:18:52,640 --> 00:19:01,510
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

381
00:19:01,940 --> 00:19:10,430
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
